msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam to test your quantum chemistry skills and receive a "
"badge from the IBM Training website."
msgstr ""
"Kumuha ng pagsusulit na may 20 tanong para masubok ang iyong mga kasanayan "
"sa quantum chemistry at makatanggap ng badge mula sa IBM Training website."

